      "bundle_offset": 4407627,
      "category": "engineering",
      "content_binding": null,
      "description": "Build elaborate, multi-component React artifacts with Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui. Full stack for creating production-ready web components and applications.",
      "github_url": "https://github.com/anthropics/skills/tree/main/skills/web-artifacts-builder",
      "slug": "web-artifacts-builder",
      "source": "anthropic",
      "source_label": "Anthropic",
      "stars_reported": 45509,
      "template_expressions": [],
      "title": "Web Artifacts Builder"
    },
    "line_table": [
      {
        "line": 1,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 2,
        "text": "name: web-artifacts-builder"
      },
      {
        "line": 3,
        "text": "description: Suite of tools for creating elaborate, multi-component HTML artifacts using modern frontend web technologies (React, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui). Use for complex artifacts requiring state management, routing, or shadcn/ui components."
      },
      {
        "line": 4,
        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 5,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 6,
        "text": "# Web Artifacts Builder"
      },
      {
        "line": 7,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 8,
        "text": "To build powerful frontend artifacts, follow these steps:"
      },
      {
        "line": 9,
        "text": "1. Initialize the frontend repo using `scripts/init-artifact.sh`"
      },
      {
        "line": 10,
        "text": "2. Develop your artifact by editing the generated code"
      },
      {
        "line": 11,
        "text": "3. Bundle all code into a single HTML file using `scripts/bundle-artifact.sh`"
      },
      {
        "line": 12,
        "text": "4. Display artifact to user"
      },
      {
        "line": 13,
        "text": "5. (Optional) Test the artifact"
      },
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": "**Stack**: React 18 + TypeScript + Vite + Parcel (bundling) + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui"
      },
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 17,
        "text": "## Design & Style Guidelines"
      },
      {
        "line": 18,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 19,
        "text": "VERY IMPORTANT: To avoid what is often referred to as \"AI slop\", avoid using excessive centered layouts, purple gradients, uniform rounded corners, and Inter font."
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 21,
        "text": "## Quick Start"
      },
      {
        "line": 22,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": "### Step 1: Initialize Project"
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 25,
        "text": "Run the initialization script to create a new React project:"
      },
      {
        "line": 26,
        "text": "```bash"
      },
      {
        "line": 27,
        "text": "bash scripts/init-artifact.sh <project-name>"
      },
      {
        "line": 28,
        "text": "cd <project-name>"
      },
      {
        "line": 29,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 31,
        "text": "This creates a fully configured project with:"
      },
      {
        "line": 32,
        "text": "- React + TypeScript (via Vite)"
      },
      {
        "line": 33,
        "text": "- Tailwind CSS 3.4.1 with shadcn/ui theming system"
      },
      {
        "line": 34,
        "text": "- Path aliases (`@/`) configured"
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "- 40+ shadcn/ui components pre-installed"
      },
      {
        "line": 36,
        "text": "- All Radix UI dependencies included"
      },
      {
        "line": 37,
        "text": "- Parcel configured for bundling"
      },
      {
        "line": 38,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 39,
        "text": "### Step 2: Develop Your Artifact"
      },
      {
        "line": 40,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 41,
        "text": "Edit the generated files to build your artifact."
      },
      {
        "line": 42,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "### Step 3: Bundle to Single HTML File"
      },
      {
        "line": 44,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 45,
        "text": "```bash"
      },
      {
        "line": 46,
        "text": "bash scripts/bundle-artifact.sh"
      },
      {
        "line": 47,
        "text": "```"
      },
      {
        "line": 48,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 49,
        "text": "Creates `bundle.html` - a self-contained artifact with all JavaScript, CSS, and dependencies inlined."
      },
      {
        "line": 50,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 51,
        "text": "### Step 4: Share Artifact"
      },
      {
        "line": 52,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 53,
        "text": "Share the bundled HTML file so users can view it as an artifact."
      },
      {
        "line": 54,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 55,
        "text": "## Reference"
      },
      {
        "line": 56,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 57,
        "text": "- **shadcn/ui components**: https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components"
      }
    ],
